WEBVTT

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:03.830
Not yet. I'm not finished...

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:06.800
I'm going to be... the Wizard King.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.410
You? The Wizard King?

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:11.580
I have the ability to find out

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:15.130
just how much magical power 
one has with these chains.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:18.340
And you have no magic whatsoever.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:23.350
You must've been born that way.
No wonder you couldn't get a grimoire.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:25.900
To think that you lack
even an ounce of magic

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.170
in this world where magic is everything.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.770
What a priceless find!

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:33.530
<i>Huh?</i>

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:36.240
<i>What the hell?</i>

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:42.990
<i>Then no matter how hard I try, 
I won't be able to use magic?</i>

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.610
To think that someone so pathetic existed.

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:50.070
You won't even be able to find a job, 
let alone become the Wizard King!

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:55.990
I'm sure your friend, the great 
genius over there, mocks you, too.

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>Yeah, maybe.</i>

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:01.790
<i>Yuno's so amazing that he 
was chosen by the four-leaf.</i>

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:03.680
<i>I'm just...</i>

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:09.900
You can't do a thing in this world. 
Just give up on everything.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.860
You were born a loser!

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:15.600
<i>He's right.</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:20.910
<i>No matter how hard I try, 
some things just can't be helped.</i>

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:24.660
<i>I'm just going to give...</i>

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:25.910
Hey!

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.080
Who are you calling a loser?

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:32.500
Asta, it's true that you won't be 
able to become the Wizard King,

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:33.800
no matter what.

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:38.300
You hear that? Even your little friend 
is telling you it's impossible.

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:43.720
That's because I'm going 
to become the Wizard King!

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:46.140
What?

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:48.980
He's no loser.

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:51.190
He's...

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.280
Asta's my rival!

00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:58.370
Huh?

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:00.270
Him? Your rival?

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:02.620
This brat who has no 
magical power whatsoever?

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.480
Not... Not yet.

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:13.920
Sorry you had to see me 
looking that pathetic, Yuno.

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:16.550
Just a sec...

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:19.300
I'm gonna kick this guy's butt!

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:36.730
A gri... moire?

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.110
I knew it.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:42.410
There's no way that Asta 
wouldn't have been chosen!

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:51.410
<i>Asta's always been that way. 
He always does the unthinkable.</i>

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:55.370
<i>He always has before... 
and he's doing it now.</i>

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:03.180
I'm gonna become the Wizard King... 
and protect you and everyone else.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:08.510
I'm gonna make everyone even happier! 
So we can have even nicer things!

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.770
And then, I'm gonna prove to everyone...

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:14.100
Prove?

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:18.870
That even if you're poor... or an orphan...

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.990
you can still become the Wizard King.

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:48.430
<b>The Boys' Promise</b>

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:52.780
<i>Grey words can't make anything happen</i>

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:55.520
<i>I know, yeah I know</i>

00:03:55.520 --> 00:04:00.700
<i>Wishing to fly freely across the sky</i>

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:02.780
<i>I dreamed it all my life</i>

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:06.490
<i>Step by step I go, though 
it's a doubtful world </i>

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:08.590
<i>Don't care how much I fall</i>

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:12.060
<i>Instinct is my guide, I never give up</i>

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:18.420
<i>To faraway future, I burst out running</i>

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:23.820
<i>Go beyond even the unseen fears</i>

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:28.970
<i>The vision I had, so I can be myself</i>

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:34.230
<i>Someday I will write the next page</i>

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:37.750
<i>You are my hope</i>

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.480
<i>Like that page from someday</i>

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.820
<i>I was able to meet you</i>

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:45.780
<i>I call this a miracle</i>

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:59.440
<b>10 Years Ago</b>

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:00.930
W-Wait!

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:09.430
Yuno! Are you okay?!

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:14.970
Come on, Yuno.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.320
Asta...

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:23.810
Jeez. You're such a crybaby, Yuno.

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:25.940
Well...

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:27.840
It's okay!

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:30.960
I've got your back, Yuno! Okay?

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:33.990
Yeah.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:37.000
All right. Let's get going.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.510
Everyone's waiting at the top!

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:59.850
It's good, but...

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:01.730
It's hard.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.830
That's our Sister Lily.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.790
You're such an amazing cook!

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:10.990
When I grow up, will you 
marry me and cook for me?

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:16.130
It was Father who baked those. 
Would you like to marry him?

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:21.500
No! You're the one I wanna marry!

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:24.190
Sister! Marry me! Marry me! Marry me!

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:26.600
Marry me! Marry me! Marry me!

00:06:27.210 --> 00:06:29.550
Very good.

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:32.350
Asta, it's not possible.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:38.060
Sister is, um... a woman of the cloth.

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:43.570
I'm not done yet, Yuno! I won't give up 
until I'm an adult, no matter what!

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:46.790
Well, good luck with that.

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:58.890
"And then the world was covered 
in deep, deep darkness.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:02.600
Just when the demon tried 
to destroy the world..."

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:04.440
He's not gonna get away with that!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.590
"...a very brave mage appeared.

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:16.100
The brave mage fought the demon 
to bring the dawn back to the world.

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:21.330
And finally, he defeated the demon.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:26.860
The mage's light shone ever so
brightly upon the whole world.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:29.510
The long, long night had come to an end.

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:31.900
This was the dawn of our world."

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:34.440
Yes!

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:46.040
"And so, the mage was dubbed the 
Wizard King and became a legend."

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:48.080
The Wizard King...

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.570
"And they all lived happily ever after."

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:09.650
Hey, Sister.

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:12.900
The Wizard King still exists, right?

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.400
Yes.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:23.160
The title of "Wizard King" has been passed
down through many generations.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:30.410
All along, they've been
protecting us with their magic.

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:35.010
It's because of the Wizard King that
the Clover Kingdom is so peaceful.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:36.970
That's awesome!

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:40.130
Is the Wizard King really important?

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:42.570
He's the most important after the king.

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:48.870
Okay, I've made up my mind!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:52.360
About what, Asta?

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:56.650
I'm... gonna be the Wizard King!

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:03.990
Sister?

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:06.310
I'm sorry. I just wasn't expecting that.

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:09.950
What brought this on?

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:12.170
Well, he defeated the demon, right?

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.990
That means he's super strong!
And that's so cool!

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:19.110
I wanna be cool, too!

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:21.070
And...

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.830
If I become important...
If I become the Wizard King,

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:30.520
I'll be able to make everyone 
even happier, right?

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:37.190
You'll be able to wear nice clothes 
and eat all the good food you want!

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:41.120
I'm gonna make this crappy 
little church huge and amazing!

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:42.910
Crappy?

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:45.990
I'll get you whatever you want, too, Sister!

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:48.250
I'll look forward to it.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:49.420
Right, Yuno?

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:51.920
Yeah.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.230
The Wizard King...

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:56.420
I'm gonna be the Wizard King!

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:59.560
So, Sister! Marry me—

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:02.050
That's a completely different subject.

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:06.590
Not yet! I won't give up!

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:07.440
No.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.280
Not yet, yet, yet, yet!

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:10.230
No.

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:16.650
<b>December</b>

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.750
Why?!

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:32.440
Why is it I still can't use magic?!

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:36.920
Sister! I'll hang up the laundry!

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.220
Thanks, Asta.

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:40.990
So marry m—

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:41.790
No.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:43.090
Mar—

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:43.480
Nope.

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:44.340
Mar—

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:45.310
No.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:48.150
Marry me, please...

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:51.810
Don't you start crying, too, Yuno.

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:58.070
Nash... won't stop crying...

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:02.400
Yuno! Leave this to me!

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.160
Asta...

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:09.000
I'm gonna be the Wizard King, after all!

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:13.620
Making a baby or two stop 
crying is a piece of cake!

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:18.210
H-Hey! There, there! There, there, there!

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:22.720
There, there.

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.200
Way to go, Wizard King.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.680
Shut up.

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:30.250
There we go.

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:34.850
Hi there. I was wondering if one 
of you would run an errand for me.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:37.230
Me! Me! Me! Me, me!

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:39.080
I'll go!

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:41.690
Would someone deliver this to the mayor?

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:49.520
Me, me! Me! Me! Me! Me! Me!

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:47.220
It's a very important letter, you see...

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.520
Yuno, could you do it?

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.500
Huh? Me?

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.670
Well, it's a very important letter,

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:58.040
and I'm hesitant to leave it in Asta's 
hands, so I'm counting on you.

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.960
I have to go see the mayor 
in the next village over.

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:04.610
I have to ask him to spare us some 
food to make it through the winter.

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:08.260
As it stands now, we just 
don't have enough tatoes.

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:11.630
Yuno, I'll go!

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:17.800
No. Father asked me to go.

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:20.020
I-I'll go.

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:22.070
Will you be okay by yourself?

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:23.690
I'll be fine.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:25.530
I'm heading out!

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:34.070
Come on, Asta. Chop some wood.

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:37.840
You can't use magic, so at 
least do some manual labor.

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:41.730
Shut up! Did you even dig up the 
tatoes you were supposed to?

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:43.840
I dug up the ones for 
today a long time ago.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:44.920
Huh?!

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:53.110
It looks like it's going 
to get chilly tonight.

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:04.230
That's enough! Get out of my shop!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:07.400
The hell are you doing?!

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:10.600
If you want to drink any more, 
you gotta bring some cash.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.790
You ain't getting any for free!

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:17.460
I don't want your stupid 
booze anyway, you jerk!

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.030
Damn it...

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:25.010
Whoa...

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:29.400
Ow...

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:36.490
The snow's getting pretty thick.
I'll have to be careful not to slip.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:55.370
Oh, thank you. Please tell 
Father that I received it.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:58.670
I will. P-Please excuse me.

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:02.480
It's late, so be careful getting home!

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:05.750
Thank you very much!

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:27.450
I'm... sorry.

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:34.830
Yuno's taking an awfully long time.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.080
I'm hungry.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:40.530
And Father isn't back yet, either.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:42.450
Let's just eat without them.

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:45.720
No! That's not fair to Yuno!

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:46.740
Boo.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:09.760
My pendant... That's mine...

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:13.420
I'm just gonna exchange it for some cash.

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:14.700
Give it back...

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:22.830
You miserable little brat. Where do you
get off having something this extravagant?

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:26.440
Give it... back...

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:33.920
Give it back...

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:37.290
That's mine...

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:41.950
What the heck is that?

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:45.730
What do you expect to do 
to me with magic like that?

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.400
You want to fight me...

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:50.280
and die?

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:01.090
Yuno!

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:04.940
Who the hell are you, brat?

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.040
That's Yuno's!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:09.060
Give it back!

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:10.550
Give it back!

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:15.750
Give it back!

00:16:17.510 --> 00:16:20.250
Don't touch me with your filthy hands!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:23.680
You... stupid little brat!

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:34.240
Not yet!

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:37.610
Not yet!

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:38.890
Cut it out!

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:42.080
I'm not done yet!

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.310
Damn it!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:47.710
I'm not done yet!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:05.910
Damn little brat just won't give up.
What the hell's his problem?

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:10.810
Asta!

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:15.960
I'm sorry. I... I...

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:18.820
Don't worry about it.

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:23.620
I told you, I've got your back.

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:25.470
Asta...

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:31.370
Asta's always done the unthinkable.

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:37.850
Wh-What is that grimoire?

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:39.300
That sword!

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:42.810
Just who are you?!

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:51.100
You little wretch with no magical powers!

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:03.050
He... nullified my magic?

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.940
Even without magical powers...

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:14.500
I'm going to become the Wizard King!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:19.010
Not giving up...

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:27.290
is my magic!

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:50.620
I built up my muscles
since I couldn't use any magic.

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:54.530
Looks like they came in handy after all.

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:56.420
Asta...

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.890
Asta, are you okay?

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:13.280
I'm so sorry. It's all 
my fault... I'm sorry...

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:18.140
This is nothin'!

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:22.740
I'm gonna become the Wizard King.

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:28.740
I'm gonna become the Wizard King... 
and protect you and everyone else.

00:19:29.190 --> 00:19:34.030
I'm gonna make everyone even happier! 
So we can have even nicer things!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:38.350
And then, I'm gonna prove to everyone...

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.380
Prove?

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:45.470
That even if you're poor... or an orphan...

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:49.510
you can still become the Wizard King.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.540
We can?

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:52.850
Yeah.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:55.840
Can we really?

00:19:56.290 --> 00:20:00.860
Anyone can... if they work hard enough!

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.530
Anyone?

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:06.530
Me, or even you, Yuno!

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:16.530
I'll... never cry again.

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:19.560
Maybe I... no...

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:21.550
Yuno?

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:23.140
I will...

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:25.800
I'll become the Wizard King, too!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:30.620
I'll get stronger, and protect 
you and everyone else!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:34.480
I'm gonna make everyone happier! 
So we can have nicer things!

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:43.640
Yuno! Look, look! I got my own grimoire!

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:47.730
It's insanely shabby, but I'm gonna take 
good care of it for the rest of my life!

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:52.090
There, there, there, there, there. 
There, there, there, there.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.090
I guess...

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:54.720
you saved me again.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:00.590
I'll repay you for this someday.

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:03.090
Asta...

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:07.450
Do you remember our promise?

00:21:08.150 --> 00:21:10.600
So you're gonna become the Wizard King, too?

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:12.430
That means...

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:14.330
Yuno, you're...

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:15.430
Asta, you're...

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:18.080
<i>...my rival!</i>

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:22.030
You mean <i>you</i> remember it?

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:26.010
I thought you were just making fun of me.

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:30.790
I have no interest in being 
too friendly with my rival.

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:35.710
But you're the one who gave me hope.

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:38.590
Even if you're poor, an orphan...

00:21:39.090 --> 00:21:40.330
or even us...

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:46.050
We can become greater than anyone 
else in this world. And to prove that...

00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:50.090
To make Sister and everyone else happy...

00:21:56.770 --> 00:22:00.100
Let's see who can become the Wizard King!

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:10.980
<i>No one can escape from here</i>

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:17.730
<i>Once again in the small closed off classroom</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:25.960
<i>The star of the class was shining yet again</i>

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:32.420
<i>They shine so bright that I close my eyes</i>

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:35.850
<i>I've thought many times</i>

00:22:36.170 --> 00:22:39.560
<i>That the revolution was within my hands</i>

00:22:39.560 --> 00:22:47.160
<i>Isn't it strange? If you want 
to laugh, go ahead and laugh</i>

00:22:47.160 --> 00:22:53.990
<i>The rest of us who were left 
behind wanted to become something</i>

00:22:54.300 --> 00:23:01.250
<i>We repeat the same morning over and over</i>

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:08.130
<i>You're the only one who 
can choose your tomorrow</i>

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:12.860
<i>Let's go beyond our current selves</i>

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:40.000
Even though I can't use magic,
I'm going to join the Magic Knights!

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:42.410
So that I can become the Wizard King!

00:23:42.410 --> 00:23:47.040
<i>Black Clover,</i> Page 3: "To the Royal 
Capital of the Clover Kingdom!"

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:51.390
Page 3

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:49.960
Not giving up is my magic!
